              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima yaitira Abanyaedomu kakumi omu ruhanga rw'Omwonyo, kandi yaateera Seela, yaagikubuura, yaagyeta Yokise-eli nk'oku erikwetwa n'okuhitsya hati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
