            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.25.17+2CH.25.18+2CH.25.19+2CH.25.20+2CH.25.21+2CH.25.22+2CH.25.23+2CH.25.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 25:17-24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Amazia yaatuma entumwa ahari Yehoashi mwene Yehoahazi, mwijukuru wa Yehu omugabe wa Israeli, naagira ati: Rugayo, twereebanire akaso omu kandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.9.8+JDG.9.9+JDG.9.10+JDG.9.11+JDG.9.12+JDG.9.13+JDG.9.14+JDG.9.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bar 9:8-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yehoashi omugabe wa Israeli yaatuma ahari Amazia omugabe wa Yuda naagira ati: Eitojo rya Lebanooni rikatuma aha mwereezi gwa Lebanooni nirigira riti: Ha mutabani wangye muhara waawe, amushere. Ku bwaseesire, enyamaishwa y'omu ihamba rya Lebanooni yaija neerabaho, yaariribata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
